1. Make sure your content is actually crawlable

Your immersive experience is largely WebGL + JS UI. That’s fine for humans, but search engines need:

    Text content in the HTML (not just in images or canvas).
    Normal links (<a href="...">) to collections & products.

Practical steps for your theme

    Use real <a> tags for navigation targets where possible

