    Indexable editorial content

You already have sections/immersive-editorial.liquid—this is perfect for SEO:

    Make sure each editorial section is:
        Rendered in the HTML of index.json (as you’re doing).
        Uses semantic tags (<section>, <article>, <h2>, <p>, <ul>, etc.).
        Has actual descriptive copy around your brands / occasions / collections.

